<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix A: LLM prompts for Global Review Stage</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Global Review stage performs global analysis of the entire script through four specialized evaluators. Each evaluator focuses on a specific aspect of script quality and provides targeted suggestions for improvement.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Engagement Evaluator</h3>

<div id="A1.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Engagement Evaluator assesses the story’s appeal, considering plot progression, dramatic tension to enhance the story’s excitement. It focuses on evaluating how effectively the narrative captures and maintains audience attention through compelling story elements, pacing dynamics, and engaging plot developments that create emotional investment and sustained interest throughout the script.</p>
</div>
