</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T4.1.28" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.1.28.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A1.T4.1.28.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T4.1.28.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T4.1.28.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">6. Your suggestions should transform the script into something truly memorable and distinctive</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T4.1.29" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.1.29.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
