<section id="A1.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Character Evaluator</h3>

<div id="A1.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Character Evaluator analyzes character arcs, motivations, and psychological depth, evaluating for consistency, developmental trajectory, and relational dynamics.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T5" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T5.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
