<section id="A1.SSx5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Global Review Integrator</h3>

<div id="A1.SSx5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SSx5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Global Review Integrator bridges the high-level recommendations of the Global Review with the newly generated scene sequence, mapping abstract strategies to specific scenes, which ensures that the improvement strategies aligned with the overall narrative structure.</p>
</div>
