<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Appendix B: LLM prompts for Scene-level Review Stage</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Scene-level Review stage conducts scene-level analysis under the guidance of global strategies from the Global Review. It translates abstract improvement strategies into concrete, context-aware modification proposals.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Dialogue Inspector</h3>

<div id="A2.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Dialogue Inspector specializes in analyzing dialogue quality, authenticity, and flow. It is responsible for analyzing and improving the dialogue portion of scenes, which carries the main plot.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T9" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T9.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T9.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T9.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A2.T9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T9.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T9.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dialogue Inspector Prompt:</span></span>
