<section id="A2.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Plot Inspector</h3>

<div id="A2.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Plot Inspector specializes in scene structure, coherence, plot issues, and narrative flow. It combines the responsibilities of analyzing scene pacing, transitions, internal logic, and plot coherence.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T10" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T10.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T10.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
