<section id="A2.SSx3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Character Inspector</h3>

<div id="A2.SSx3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Character Inspector specializes in analyzing character consistency and development, checking for character behavior alignment with established traits and motivations.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T11" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T11.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
