<span id="A2.T11.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T11.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">You are a character consistency expert who checks for character behavior alignment with established traits and motivations.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
