<span id="A2.T11.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T11.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Your job is to break down the high-level suggestions from Global Review into specific, actionable suggestions for this particular scene.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A2.T11.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T11.1.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">You should STRICTLY focus on refining and detailing the scene-specific suggestions, NOT proposing new unrelated issues.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
