<section id="A2.SSx4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Scene Description Inspector</h3>

<div id="A2.SSx4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Scene Description Inspector specializes in analyzing and improving scene descriptions, focusing on enhancing the visual and sensory elements of scenes.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T12" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T12.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T12.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T12.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A2.T12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T12.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T12.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Scene Description Inspector Prompt:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T12.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T12.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A2.T12.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T12.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T12.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">You are a scene description expert who analyzes and improves the visual and sensory elements of scenes.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T12.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T12.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
