<section id="A2.SSx5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Scene-level Review Integrator</h3>

<div id="A2.SSx5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Scene-level Review Integrator synthesizes and consolidates suggestions from multiple specialized agents (Dialogue Inspector, Plot Inspector, Character Inspector, and Scene Description Inspector) into coherent, prioritized recommendations for each scene.</p>
</div>
