<span id="A2.T13.1.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T13.1.16.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">3. Resolve contradictions by prioritizing based on scene context and narrative importance</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T13.1.17" class="ltx_tr">
