<span id="A2.T13.1.22.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T13.1.22.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Focus on creating synergy between dialogue, scene structure, character consistency, and description</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T13.1.23" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T13.1.23.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
