<span id="A2.T13.1.23.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T13.1.23.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Prioritize suggestions that address multiple agent concerns simultaneously</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T13.1.24" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T13.1.24.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A2.T13.1.24.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
