<section id="A2.SSx6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Suggestion Router</h3>

<div id="A2.SSx6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Suggestion Router performs context-aware intelligent classification of integrated suggestions, categorizing each as either dialogue or scene description modifications.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T14" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T14.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T14.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T14.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A2.T14.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T14.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T14.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Suggestion Router Prompt:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
