<td id="A2.T14.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A2.T14.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T14.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T14.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">You are an expert script analyst who can accurately classify improvement suggestions as either related to dialogue or scene description.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T14.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T14.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
