<span id="A2.T14.1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T14.1.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">IMPORTANT: You must choose ONLY ONE category - either ’dialogue’ or ’scene_description’. Even if the suggestion seems to apply to both, choose the category that is MORE dominant or relevant.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
