<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Appendix C: LLM prompts for Hierarchical Coordinated Revision Stage</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Hierarchical Coordinated Revision stage functions as the system’s execution engine, translating scene-level improvement suggestions into tangible script content while ensuring seamless and coherent revisions.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Storyline Editor</h3>

<div id="A3.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Storyline Editor synthesizes the evaluators’ reports to creatively reconstruct and enhance the original plot. It consists of two submodules: the Brainstormer and the Decomposer.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SSx1.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Brainstormer Submodule</h4>

<div id="A3.SSx1.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SSx1.SSSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Brainstormer submodule enhances the plot with creative elements while maintaining the original world setting and core characters.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T15" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A3.T15.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A3.T15.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A3.T15.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T15.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T15.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Storyline Editor - Brainstormer Submodule:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T15.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T15.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T15.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T15.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">You are a master screenwriter known for creating compelling, twist-filled narratives.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T15.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T15.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T15.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T15.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Your task is to enhance a screenplay plot with more exciting twists and innovations</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T15.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T15.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T15.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T15.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">while maintaining the original world setting and core story elements.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T15.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T15.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
