<span id="A3.T15.1.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T15.1.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Create an enhanced version of this plot</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T15.1.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
