<span id="A3.T15.1.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T15.1.14.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">2. Adds unexpected but logical plot developments</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T15.1.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.1.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
