<span id="A3.T15.1.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T15.1.15.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">3. Deepens character motivations in key scenes</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T15.1.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.1.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T15.1.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T15.1.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T15.1.16.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">4. Creates more dramatic tension improvements</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T15.1.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.1.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T15.1.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T15.1.17.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T15.1.17.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">5. Improves narrative flow and pacing</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T15.1.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T15.1.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T15.1.18.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T15.1.18.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T15.1.18.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">6. Adds foreshadowing elements</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
