<section id="A3.SSx4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Script Description Editor</h3>

<div id="A3.SSx4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SSx4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Script Description Editor is responsible for revising the script’s title and character descriptions to align with the enhanced content.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SSx4.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
