<section id="A3.SSx4.SSSx2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Character Description Editor Submodule</h4>

<div id="A3.SSx4.SSSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SSx4.SSSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Character Description Editor Submodule enhances character descriptions based on their portrayal in the enhanced screenplay, which ensures that descriptions maintain consistency with the emotions and character arcs of the characters in the improved story</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T20" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A3.T20.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A3.T20.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T20.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A3.T20.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T20.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T20.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Script Description Editor - Character Description Editor Submodule:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T20.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T20.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T20.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T20.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T20.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">You are a master screenplay character analyst. Your task is to polish and enhance</span></span>
