<section id="A3.SSx5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Script Polisher</h3>

<div id="A3.SSx5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SSx5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Script Polisher serves as the final quality assurance module, conducting a comprehensive review of the entire script for polish and consistency.</p>
</div>
