</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.18.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.18.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.18.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1. Character-Specific Enhancements</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.19.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.19.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Make each character’s dialogue distinctly reflect their personality, background, and emotional state</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.20.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.20.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.20.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Ensure vocabulary, speech patterns, and expressions are consistent with established traits</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.21" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.21.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.21.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.21.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Add character-specific mannerisms, habits, and physical actions that reveal personality</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.22" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.22.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.22.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.22.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.22.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">2. Psychological Depth</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.23" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.23.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.23.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.23.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.23.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Add internal thoughts and psychological insights in parentheses</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.24" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.24.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.24.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.24.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.24.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Show conflicting emotions and motivations within characters</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.25" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.25.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.25.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.25.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.25.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Reveal subtext through micro-expressions, pauses, and non-verbal cues</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.26" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.26.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.26.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.26.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.26.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">3. Detailed Actions and Environment Interaction</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.27" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.27.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.27.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.27.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.27.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Include specific physical actions that reveal character and advance the story</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.28" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.28.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.28.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.28.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.28.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Show how characters interact with the environment and objects in the scene</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.29" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.29.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.29.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.29.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.29.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Use sensory details to ground the dialogue in the physical setting</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.30" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.30.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.30.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.30.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.30.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">4. Scene Connections (CRITICAL)</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.31" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.31.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.31.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.31.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.31.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Ensure dialogue clearly connects to previous scenes and sets up future scenes</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.32" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.32.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.32.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.32.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.32.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Address any unresolved questions or issues from previous scenes</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.33" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.33.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.33.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.33.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.33.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Plant seeds for upcoming developments or conflicts</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.34" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.34.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.34.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.34.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.34.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Create smooth transitions between scenes with dialogue hooks</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.35" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.35.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.35.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.35.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.35.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">5. Logical Completeness</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.36" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.36.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.36.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.36.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.36.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Ensure scene has clear beginning, middle, and end with proper dramatic structure</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.37" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.37.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.37.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.37.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.37.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Make sure all introduced elements and questions are addressed within the scene</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.38" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.38.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.38.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.38.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.38.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Verify that character motivations and actions are consistent and logical</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.39" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.39.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.39.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.39.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.39.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Strictly return JSON format:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.40" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.40.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.40.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.40.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.40.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.41" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.41.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.41.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T22.1.41.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T22.1.41.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">  "polished_dialogue": "Your enhanced dialogue with detailed actions and psychological elements..."</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T22.1.42" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T22.1.42.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A3.T22.1.42.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
